{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1783272806801,"sessionID":"ses_0ccaa9c5affeZxqU483mL6ImW7","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"write","callID":"call_01_FebtMWXJdgmaqyPZtdTl5539","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/Users/yt/task/pc-lib-analysis/runs/software42/FFmpeg/2026-07-05T16-06-55-689Z/blocks/function_summary.json","content":"{
  "summary": "FFmpeg 是全球最广泛使用的跨平台开源音视频处理库与工具集，提供编解码、格式封装/解封装、媒体过滤、颜色/分辨率转换、音频重采样及设备采集等完整多媒体管线。包含 7 个核心库（libavcodec、libavformat、libavutil、libavfilter、libavdevice、libswresample、libswscale）及 ffmpeg/ffplay/ffprobe 命令行工具，覆盖数百种编码格式与传输协议，支持硬件加速（CUDA/VAAPI/D3D11VA/Vulkan/VideoToolbox 等），被 VLC、Chromium、Blender 等海量项目依赖。",
  "categories": [
    {
      "name": "音视频编解码",
      "description": "提供数百种音视频编解码器（H.264/H.265/AV1/VP9/MP3/AAC/Opus 等），含内置软件实现与通过外部库（libx264/libx265/libvpx/libopus 等）及硬件加速 API（CUDA/VAAPI/D3D11VA/Metal/VideoToolbox/Vulkan）的编解码能力。",
      "evidence": ["libavcodec/avcodec.h", "libavcodec/h264dec.c", "libavcodec/hevcdec.c", "libavcodec/aacdec.c", "libavcodec/aacenc.c", "libavcodec/hwaccel.h"]
    },
    {
      "name": "媒体容器封装与解封装",
      "description": "支持 MP4/MKV/AVI/TS/FLV/MOV/WebM 等数十种容器格式的读写，以及 HTTP/HLS/RTMP/SRT/RIST/WebRTC 等流媒体协议的输入输出。",
      "evidence": ["libavformat/avformat.h", "libavformat/movenc.c", "libavformat/matroskadec.c", "libavformat/http.c", "libavformat/rtmpproto.c"]
    },
    {
      "name": "音视频过滤与特效",
      "description": "提供数百种音视频滤镜，支持缩放/裁剪/去噪/去交错/字幕叠加/画中画/转场/音量调节/混音等后处理，基于有向图连接实现复杂过滤链。",
